{
  "format": "uncertainty-calculations/project",
  "version": 1,
  "metadata": {
    "id": "ea402-s10-vernier-calliper",
    "title": {
      "en": "Calibration of a vernier calliper at 150 mm",
      "tr": "Kumpasın 150 mm'de kalibrasyonu"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "EA-4/02 S10: error of a vernier calliper measured with a gauge block; two rectangular terms dominate (trapezoidal output).",
      "tr": "EA-4/02 S10: kumpas hatasının mastar bloğuyla ölçülmesi; iki dikdörtgen terim baskındır (yamuk çıktı)."
    },
    "explanation": [
      {
        "en": "E_X = l_iX − l_S + L·ᾱ·Δt + δl_iX + δl_M (µm).",
        "tr": "E_X = l_iX − l_S + L·ᾱ·Δt + δl_iX + δl_M (µm)."
      },
      {
        "en": "The resolution (±25 µm) and the mechanical effects (±50 µm) are rectangular; their convolution is trapezoidal with β = (50 − 25)/(50 + 25) = 0.33, giving k = 1.83 for 95 % (Eq. S10.9) and U ≈ 60 µm.",
        "tr": "Çözünürlük (±25 µm) ve mekanik etkiler (±50 µm) dikdörtgen dağılımlıdır; konvolüsyonları β = (50 − 25)/(50 + 25) = 0,33 olan yamuk dağılımdır ve %95 için k = 1,83 (Eş. S10.9), U ≈ 60 µm verir."
      }
    ],
    "field": "length",
    "sources": [
      {
        "document": "EA-4/02 M:2022, Evaluation of the Uncertainty of Measurement in Calibration",
        "section": "S10",
        "url": "https://european-accreditation.org/wp-content/uploads/2018/10/EA-4-02.pdf"
      }
    ],
    "tags": [
      "ea-4/02",
      "calibration",
      "validation",
      "dominant-rectangular",
      "trapezoidal"
    ]
  },
  "model": {
    "output": {
      "name": "E_X",
      "unit": "µm",
      "expression": "l_iX - l_S + 150000*11.5e-6*dt + dl_iX + dl_M",
      "description": {
        "en": "Error of indication",
        "tr": "Gösterge hatası"
      }
    },
    "inputs": [
      {
        "name": "l_iX",
        "unit": "µm",
        "description": {
          "en": "Indication",
          "tr": "Gösterge"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "constant",
          "value": 150100.0
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "l_S",
        "unit": "µm",
        "description": {
          "en": "Length of the gauge block",
          "tr": "Mastar bloğunun boyu"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 150000.0,
          "half_width": 0.8
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "dt",
        "unit": "K",
        "description": {
          "en": "Temperature difference calliper–block",
          "tr": "Kumpas–blok sıcaklık farkı"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 0.0,
          "half_width": 2.0
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "dl_iX",
        "unit": "µm",
        "description": {
          "en": "Resolution of the scale",
          "tr": "Skala çözünürlüğü"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 0.0,
          "half_width": 25.0
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "dl_M",
        "unit": "µm",
        "description": {
          "en": "Mechanical effects (force, flatness, parallelism)",
          "tr": "Mekanik etkiler (kuvvet, düzlemsellik, paralellik)"
        },
        "distribution": {
          "type": "rectangular",
          "value": 0.0,
          "half_width": 50.0
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "analysis": {
    "gum": {
      "coverage_factor": 2
    },
    "mcm": {
      "trials": 1000000,
      "seed": 10,
      "coverage_probability": 0.95
    }
  },
  "expected": {
    "gum": {
      "estimate": {
        "value": 100.0,
        "tolerance": 1e-09
      },
      "standard_uncertainty": {
        "value": 32.0,
        "tolerance": 0.5
      }
    },
    "reference": {
      "en": "EA-4/02 M:2022 S10.10–S10.12 (u = 32 µm).",
      "tr": "EA-4/02 M:2022 S10.10–S10.12 (u = 32 µm)."
    }
  }
}
